\ End-to-end exercise of a user-defined virtual type under runtime-image
\ AOT. Covers wrap (>name), raw constructor (make-name), positional
\ unwrap, predicate. The virtual generator emits compound bodies that
\ push the TypeValue as a .type_val literal; every such push routes
\ through the runtime-image slot table.

weight: virtual{ fixnum } ;

\ Raw constructor + positional unwrap.
42 make-weight unmake-weight .

\ Hash-based wrap on the backing type produces an instance with the
\ same payload.
7 >weight unmake-weight .

\ Predicate distinguishes wrapped instances from foreign values.
13 make-weight weight? .
"not-a-weight" weight? .

\ Round-trip through wrap-unwrap-wrap preserves the payload.
100 make-weight unmake-weight >weight unmake-weight .
